ted to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Things in a Store "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " In a clothing store, you can ask for the size and the color you want."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Size</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\"> Asking for Color</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does this come in a size ... ?<br/>Do you have this in a ... ?<br/>Do you have this in small/medium/large?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does this come in a different color?<br/>Do you have this in ... ?<br/>What other colors does this come in?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Sizes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Different countries and stores have different ways of measuring sizes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In North America, sizes of clothes like coats and shirts are often measured in words: <span class = \"strong\">small</span>, <span class = \"strong\">medium</span> or <span class = \"strong\">large</span>. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "These words are often written in the letter form:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "XS = extra small<br/> S = small<br/> M = medium<br/> L = large<br/> XL = extra large"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Shoes are usually measured in numbers (7 - 13)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Belts and jeans are usually measured by the size of the person's waist (28\u201d - 40\u201d). The \" sign means <span class = \"italic\">inches</span> (= 2.5 cm)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Dresses are usually measured in numbers  (0 - 18)."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Coats and Shirts</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Shoes</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Jeans Belt (Waist)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Dresses</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"small (S)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"7 - 8\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"28\u201d - 32\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0 - 4\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"medium (M)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"9 - 10\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"34\u201d - 36\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"6 - 10\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"large (L)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"11 - 13\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"38\u201d - 40\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 - 18\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "This dress is a size 18."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I wear size 9 shoes."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you have this in 28\u201d waist?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shoes"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what you wear on your feet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need new shoes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you shop for shoes."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pair"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "set of two"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have three pairs of shoes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to spend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay out money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes are reduced from $125 to $50."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bargain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at a very low price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes were a bargain - only $25."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cost"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price of an item"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes cost $99."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'll take"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " I want to buy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll take these shoes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "budget"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the amount of money you can spend"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a budget of $200 for shoes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reduced"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the price is lower  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These shoes are reduced from $125 to $50."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le07ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le07ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find the website of a clothing store."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find 5 items."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find the sizes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your findings with a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Item of Clothing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sizes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for a website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write items of clothing and sizes in the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my findings with